{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d10","docs":{"io/output/d10/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Port physique D10","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.binding_port.label","help":"Identifiant du port physique piloté par la sortie D10. Utiliser \"Non connecté\" pour laisser cette sortie logique non affectée.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d10/d10_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 D10","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, D10 est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_active_high.help"},"io/output/d10/d10_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON D10","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie D10.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d10/d10_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion D10","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour D10.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_momentary.help"},"io/output/d10/d10_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_name.help","label":"Nom sortie D10","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie digitale D10.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_name.help"},"io/output/d10/d10_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion D10 (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de D10.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.d10_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d10/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot D10","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si D10 applique son état initial au démarrage ou tente de conserver le latch matériel lors d'un reboot chaud. Sur MCP23017, la conservation est ignorée et l'état initial est appliqué.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d10.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}